ent-ActionProperKungFuWolfDance = Wolf Dance
    .desc = Roll forward toward a target up to 5 tiles away, dash into it at an angle and finish with a roundhouse kick that knocks them down and sends them flying. A held shield blocks the kick but gets knocked out of the hands. Right after a Claw Series the kick hits much harder and sends the target further, but only knocks them down. Right after a Claw Whirlwind it is a single fast straight dash instead of the roll, the target flies 5 tiles, but you fall too.
ent-ActionProperKungFuClawWhirlwind = Claw Whirlwind
    .desc = Throw a target within fist reach over yourself and meet their jaw with your knee (10 Blunt to the head, broken skull, brain trauma). They slowly spin up into the air and crash down. The target can't move for about 2 seconds. Shields don't help. A Wolf Dance within 2 seconds becomes a single fast dash that sends the target 5 tiles away, but you fall too. Right after a Wolf Grip it becomes a two-handed cross strike instead of the throw.
